<view class="help-page"><view class="help-body"><view class="help-stage"><text>元享帮助中心</text><view>每一步，<text>都为你说明白。</text></view><yx-icon name="support" tone="light" size="154"/></view><view class="help-categories"><view class="{{activeCategory==='all'?'active':''}}" data-category="all" bindtap="chooseCategory">全部问题</view><view class="{{activeCategory==='coins'?'active':''}}" data-category="coins" bindtap="chooseCategory">金币</view><view class="{{activeCategory==='redeem'?'active':''}}" data-category="redeem" bindtap="chooseCategory">兑换</view><view class="{{activeCategory==='trial'?'active':''}}" data-category="trial" bindtap="chooseCategory">试用</view></view><view class="faq-list"><view wx:for="{{visibleQuestions}}" wx:key="id" class="faq-item {{expanded===item.id?'open':''}}"><view class="faq-heading" bindtap="toggleQuestion" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text>{{item.number}}</text><text>{{item.question}}</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="26"/></view><view wx:if="{{expanded===item.id}}" class="faq-content"><text>{{item.answer}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.tip}}" class="faq-tip">{{item.tip}}</text></view></view></view><view class="help-more"><text>还没有找到答案？</text><text>微信客服会协助你核对具体情况</text></view></view><view class="help-footer-spacer"></view><view class="help-footer"><button class="ui-primary" open-type="contact"><yx-icon name="support" tone="light" size="40"/>联系微信客服</button></view></view>
